WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.880
Program for this year, embracing as it does over one million boys, lasts throughout the

00:12.880 --> 00:31.880
year.

00:31.880 --> 00:54.000
I am glad to know that the selection of these boys is being made on the basis of merit,

00:54.000 --> 00:59.280
and furthermore that in many cases these boys will come here to Washington at the expense

00:59.280 --> 01:06.320
of the troop, and not merely because the boy's economic situation in life is such as to make

01:06.320 --> 01:10.120
it possible for his parents to send him.

01:10.120 --> 01:15.200
We hope, too, that other countries will send at least small delegations to meet with us

01:15.200 --> 01:17.320
on this occasion.

01:17.320 --> 01:24.160
Because scouting is now in active operation in almost every civilized nation of the world,

01:24.160 --> 01:31.960
this will give us a splendid opportunity to enlarge our basis of mutual respect, of understanding,

01:31.960 --> 01:56.120
and of friendship among the people of the world, regardless of race or creed.

